flowchart TD
    A[Requester submits form] --> B{Required information complete?}
    B -->|No| C[Needs Information]
    C --> A
    B -->|Yes| D[Triage]
    D --> E{Special review required?}
    E -->|Funding| F[Finance review]
    E -->|Sensitive data or elevated risk| G[Security / privacy review]
    E -->|No| H[Functional fit and capacity review]
    F --> H
    G --> H
    H --> I{Decision}
    I -->|Approved| J[Approved — Planned]
    I -->|More information| C
    I -->|Declined| K[Declined / Withdrawn]
    J --> L[In Progress]
    L --> M[Completed]
